      "name": "RestoreInventorySlotsAndInputState",
      "signature": "void RestoreInventorySlotsAndInputState(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Restores all inventory slot handlers and input state after panel operations.\n\nClassification: Cleanup/Restoration - Restores saved inventory and input state.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Dispatch inventory item handler for slot 1 (g_dwInventorySlot1 at 0x6fa21818)\n2. Dispatch inventory item handler for slot 2 (g_dwInventorySlot2 at 0x6fa2181c)\n3. Dispatch inventory item handler for slot 3 (g_dwInventorySlot3 at 0x6fa21820)\n4. Dispatch inventory item handler for slot 4 (g_dwInventorySlot4 at 0x6fa21824)\n5. Dispatch inventory item handler for slot 5 (g_dwInventorySlot5 at 0x6fa21828)\n6. Dispatch inventory item handler for slot 6 (g_dwInventorySlot6 at 0x6fa2182c)\n7. Dispatch inventory item handler for slot 7 (g_dwInventorySlot7 at 0x6fa21830)\n8. Dispatch inventory item handler for slot 8 (g_dwInventorySlot8 at 0x6fa21838)\n9. Restore current input item from g_dwCurrentInputItem (0x6fa216d0)\n10. Restore current input pointer from g_pCurrentInputPointer (0x6fa218d0)\n\nParameters: None\n\nReturns: void\n\nCallers:\n- Called from 0x6fa033f2 and 0x6fa03652 as part of inventory panel teardown\n\nCalled Functions:\n- DispatchInventoryItemHandler (0x6fa12936): Processes each inventory slot state\n- SetCurrentInputItem (0x6fa12930): Restores input item selection\n- SetCurrentInputPointer (0x6fa1292a): Restores input pointer state\n\nGlobal Data:\n- g_dwInventorySlot1-8: 8 inventory slot state values at 0x6fa21818-0x6fa21838\n- g_dwCurrentInputItem (0x6fa216d0): Saved input item identifier\n- g_pCurrentInputPointer (0x6fa218d0): Saved input pointer reference\n\nNotes:\n- Slot 7 and 8 addresses are not contiguous (0x6fa21830, 0x6fa21838) suggesting\n  there may be padding or another field at 0x6fa21834",
