      "name": "InitializeGameJoinAndCopySessionData",
      "signature": "void InitializeGameJoinAndCopySessionData(char * lpszSessionData)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Initializes game join session by resetting UI state and copying session data.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Reset UI panel state by calling FUN_6fa10090 and FUN_6fa0f490\n2. Dispatch inventory item handlers for slots 1-8 to clear pending operations\n3. Set current input item and pointer from global state\n4. Loop through sub-children array dispatching inventory handlers\n5. Reset g_nNumSubChildren, g_dwInventorySubState to 0\n6. Call FUN_6fa117b0 to finalize UI state\n7. Reset g_dwInventoryExtraState and dispatch slots 9-10\n8. If g_dwSpecialModeFlag == 1, call FUN_6fa127f0\n9. If g_dwInventoryPanelMode == 3, reset to 0\n10. If g_pInventoryPanelState != NULL, call SetOrClearBitMask with flag 1\n11. Set callback to ActivateInventoryPanelStateCallback\n12. Copy game name from param_1+0x00 to g_pGameListData+0x1A (strcpy via REPNE SCASB/MOVSD)\n13. Copy password from param_1+0x10 to g_pGameListData+0x23D\n14. Copy description from param_1+0x20 to g_pGameListData+0x255\n15. Set g_dwInventoryPanelMode = 1\n16. Branch on password flag at g_pGameListData+0x225:\n    - If password empty: Set mode=6, copy in_EDX to +0x32, set g_nSubPanelState=1, call SetGameState(0), StopMessageLoop, return 1\n    - If password set: Call Ordinal_10002 (Storm.SNetJoinGame)\n17. If join fails: Reset state, show error (StringId 0x2A41), reset all buttons, create error textbox, return 0\n18. If join succeeds: Set mode=2, increment g_wSessionRequestId, call Ordinal_10053/10004, save request ID, return 1\n\nParameters:\n  lpszSessionData (ECX): char* - Session data structure containing:\n    +0x00: Game name string (copied to g_pGameListData+0x1A)\n    +0x10: Password string (copied to g_pGameListData+0x23D)\n    +0x20: Description string (copied to g_pGameListData+0x255)\n  IMPLICIT in_EDX: char* - Additional password/description string for open games\n\nReturns:\n  1 - Success (game join initiated or open game mode started)\n  0 - Failure (join attempt failed, error displayed)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- If g_pGameListData+0x225 is empty (no password), enters open game mode\n- Password-protected games call Storm.SNetJoinGame (Ordinal_10002)\n- On join failure, extensive cleanup and error textbox creation occurs\n\nGlobals Modified:\n- g_nNumSubChildren, g_dwInventorySubState, g_dwInventoryExtraState: Reset to 0\n- g_dwInventoryPanelMode: Set to 1 (or 0 on failure)\n- g_nSubPanelState: Set to 1 for open games\n- g_wSessionRequestId: Incremented for tracking\n- g_wLastSessionRequestId: Saved copy of request ID\n- _g_pfnSubPanelCallback: Set to ActivateInventoryPanelStateCallback\n\nOrdinal References:\n- Ordinal_10002: Storm.SNetJoinGame - Joins a Battle.net game session\n- Ordinal_10053: Storm.SNetSetGameMode - Sets game mode flags\n- Ordinal_10004: Storm.SNetInitializeProvider - Initializes network provider",
