      "name": "SetGameListText",
      "signature": "int SetGameListText(wchar_t * lpwszText)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "Sets the text content of the Battle.net game list control.\n\nClassification: Worker function - called by game list UI update routines\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Clear all existing text from the game list control\n2. Add new text with color code 3 (gold/yellow) and flag 0\n3. Return success (1)\n\nParameters:\n  lpwszText (ECX) - Wide string to display in game list control\n\nReturns:\n  int - Always returns 1 (success)\n\nCallers:\n  FUN_6fa0b8a0 - Game entry creation/update\n  FUN_6fa0c2f0 - Game list refresh/cleanup\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - No validation of lpwszText; assumes valid pointer\n  - Color code 3 = gold/yellow text color\n  - Flag 0 = default text formatting",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "CAL",
      "index": "CAL:a853bb20e36d907d6d12f05e79a7d038",
