      "name": "InitSubPanelUI",
      "signature": "void InitSubPanelUI(wchar_t * wszPanelText, void * pfnCallback)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Initializes a sub-panel UI with text display and optional callback handler.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Destroy all existing sub-children by calling DispatchInventoryItemHandler on each element\n2. Reset g_nNumSubChildren to 0\n3. Restore current input item via SetCurrentInputItem(g_dwCurrentInputItem)\n4. Reset g_dwInventorySubState to 0\n5. Create inventory button via CreateObjectByTypeFactory(g_UITypeInventoryButton)\n6. Add button to g_apSubChildrenArray, increment count, set as last inventory item\n7. Enable button flags via SetUnitFlags(pButton, 1)\n8. Create secondary button via CreateObjectByTypeFactory(g_UITypeSecondaryButton)\n9. Add secondary button to array, increment count, enable flags\n10. Create text box via CreateObjectByTypeFactory(g_UITypeInventoryTextBox)\n11. Add text box to array, increment count, enable flags\n12. Set text box content via TextBoxAddText(pTextBox, wszPanelText, 0, 0)\n13. Set g_pfnSubPanelCallback to pfnCallback (or FUN_6fa06a10 if NULL)\n\nParameters:\n  wszPanelText (ECX): Wide string text to display in the sub-panel text box\n  pfnCallback (EDX): Callback function for sub-panel events (NULL uses default FUN_6fa06a10)\n\nReturns:\n  void\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Max 32 sub-children enforced (0x20), asserts via FogAssert if exceeded\n  - Assert message: szAssertMaxChildren at szSourceFilePath line 0x1086\n  - NULL callback defaults to FUN_6fa06a10 (default sub-panel handler)\n\nGlobals Modified:\n  - g_nNumSubChildren: Reset to 0 then incremented for each UI element created\n  - g_dwInventorySubState: Reset to 0\n  - g_apSubChildrenArray: Populated with 3 new UI elements\n  - g_pfnSubPanelCallback: Set to callback or default handler",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "CAL",
      "index": "CAL:8a4ee7ef73f428447b93a3fa3fdbed1a",
