      "name": "InitializeCharacterClassPanel",
      "signature": "int InitializeCharacterClassPanel(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "InitializeCharacterClassPanel - Initializes character class selection panel UI\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Reset button frame values for panel slots 1-6 to inactive (0)\n2. If panel reset flag is set, also reset slots 7-8\n3. Set panel slot 5 as active (1) - default selected slot\n4. Early exit if display flags are 0x0D (13) or 0x04 (4)\n5. Set command buffer size to 200 (0xC8)\n6. Clear text data list for inventory extra state\n7. Initialize 2 Unicode objects via default constructor loop\n8. Format character class pattern string via FUN_6fa12b5e\n9. Convert ANSI to Unicode via win2Unicode\n10. Add text lines to inventory state with width=200, style=4\n11. Navigate scrollbar to index 0\n12. Calculate class index offset based on display flags range:\n    - Flags 9-16 (0x09-0x10): offset = 9 (0x09)\n    - Flags 0-7: offset = 0\n    - Flags 19-26 (0x13-0x1A): offset = 19 (0x13)\n    - Flags 27-34 (0x1B-0x22): offset = 27 (0x1B)\n    - Other values: Assert failure and exit\n13. Set panel scroll offset to -2 (0xFFFFFFFE)\n14. Enable class list (g_fClassListEnabled = 1)\n15. Clear panel state A\n16. Update display flags byte to (offset + 4)\n\nParameters:\n- None (void)\n\nReturns:\n- int: Always returns 1 (success)\n\nLocal Variables:\n- chClassIndexOffset (AL): Class index base offset based on display flags range\n- dwDisplayFlags (EAX): Masked display flags for range comparison\n- nLoopCounter (EDI): Unicode initialization loop counter (2 iterations)\n- pUnicodeIter (ESI): Pointer iterating through Unicode array\n- awUnicodeBuffer (Stack[-0x4]): 4-byte Unicode character buffer\n- szAnsiBuffer (Stack[-0x6]): 2-byte ANSI string buffer\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0xC8 (200): Command buffer size / text line width\n- 0x0D (13), 0x04 (4): Display flag values that skip initialization\n- 0xFFFFFFFE (-2): Initial panel scroll offset\n- Range mappings: 9-16->9, 0-7->0, 19-26->19, 27-34->27\n\nGlobals Accessed:\n- g_dwPanelStateSlot1-8: Panel button states\n- g_dwPanelResetFlag: Controls whether to reset slots 7-8\n- g_byPanelDisplayFlags: Display mode flags byte\n- g_szCommandBufferEnd: Command buffer size\n- g_dwInventoryExtraState: Inventory UI state handle\n- g_nPanelScrollOffset: Panel scroll position\n- g_fClassListEnabled: Class list visibility flag\n- g_dwPanelStateA: Panel state variable",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
