      "name": "SubmitChatEditBoxInputEmoteMode",
      "signature": "int SubmitChatEditBoxInputEmoteMode(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "Submits chat edit box input formatted as emote (/me action).\n\nCLASSIFICATION: Callback/Handler - UI callback invoked for emote-style chat input\n\nALGORITHM:\n1. Get Unicode text from current input edit box via D2Win_GetEditBoxChild\n2. If edit box child is NULL, return success (1)\n3. Get length of Unicode text via Unicode::strlen\n4. If text is empty (length 0), return success (1)\n5. Convert Unicode text to ANSI via Unicode::unicode2Win into 300-byte buffer\n6. If text starts with '/' (is a command), skip emote processing and return 1\n7. Get current tick count via GetTickCount\n8. Check rate limit: if less than 1000ms since last emote, skip and return 1\n9. Update g_dwLastEmoteTick with current tick count\n10. Format text as \"/me %s\" via FUN_6fa12b5e into second 300-byte buffer\n11. Send formatted emote via ProcessChatCommandAndUIMessage(szEmoteBuffer, 0)\n12. Return 1 (success)\n\nPARAMETERS:\n  None (parameterless callback)\n\nRETURNS:\n  int - Always returns 1 (success)\n\nSPECIAL CASES:\n  - Empty input text silently returns 1\n  - NULL edit box child returns 1\n  - Text starting with '/' is ignored (not wrapped as emote)\n  - Rate-limited to one emote per 1000ms to prevent spam\n\nGLOBALS ACCESSED:\n  g_pCurrentInputPointer (0x6fa218d0) - Current input edit box control pointer\n  g_dwLastEmoteTick (0x6fa21aac) - Tick count of last emote sent (rate limiting)\n  szFmtMeEmote (0x6fa1d888) - Format string \"/me %s\"\n\nCROSS-REFERENCES:\n  - Referenced from function pointer table at 0x6fa1b260\n  - Called by UI system as emote-mode submit callback\n\nRELATED FUNCTIONS:\n  SubmitChatEditBoxInput (0x6fa0af00) - Standard chat submit (no emote wrapping)\n  SubmitChatEditBoxInputWhisperMode (0x6fa0af60) - Whisper mode submit\n\nLOCAL VARIABLES:\n  pUVar1 (pUnicodeText) - Unicode * - Unicode text from edit box\n  iVar2 (nTextLength) - int - Length of unicode text\n  DVar3 (dwCurrentTick) - uint - Current tick count from GetTickCount\n  acStack_258 (szAnsiBuffer) - char[300] - ANSI conversion buffer\n  acStack_12c (szEmoteBuffer) - char[300] - Formatted emote command buffer",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "STR",
      "index": "STR:c894ff12678229ec2334b213402ef719",
