      "name": "AddGameEntryThunk",
      "signature": "bool AddGameEntryThunk(void * this, uint dwFlags, byte * pbGameName, uint * pdwResult)",
      "calling_convention": "__thiscall",
      "return_type": "bool",
      "comment": "Thunk wrapper that adds a game entry to the Battle.net game list.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Reorder parameters from thiscall convention to fastcall\n2. Call AddGameToListAndInitialize(pbGameName, pdwResult, dwFlags)\n3. Return TRUE indicating successful dispatch\n\nParameters:\n  this (ECX) - IMPLICIT: Flags/context value passed to callee as third parameter\n  dwFlags (Stack+4) - Context flags for game entry initialization\n  pbGameName (Stack+8) - Game name string (ANSI, may contain '*' delimiter)\n  pdwResult (Stack+C) - Output pointer for result/status\n\nReturns:\n  Always returns TRUE (1) - actual success/failure in callee return\n\nClassification: Thunk/Wrapper\nWraps: FUN_6fa0b8a0 (AddGameToListAndInitialize)\nPurpose: Provides __thiscall interface for __fastcall game list function",
