      "name": "RemovePatternFromUnicodeString",
      "signature": "void RemovePatternFromUnicodeString(Unicode * pUszString)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Removes all occurrences of a pattern substring from a Unicode string in-place.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get length of input string, assert < 500 chars\n2. Get pattern string from string ID 0xf9a via ValidateStringId\n3. Get pattern length\n4. Search for pattern in string using Unicode::strstr\n5. Loop while pattern found AND character after match is not null terminator:\n   a. Get remaining string length from match position\n   b. Calculate bytes to move: (remainingLen - patternLen) * 2\n   c. Shift remaining characters left using Unicode_memmove\n   d. Search for next pattern occurrence\n6. Return (void)\n\nParameters:\n  pUszString (ECX): Unicode string to modify in-place\n\nReturns:\n  void\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Asserts if string length >= 500 (calls FogAssert then FUN_6fa12bdd(-1))\n  - Pattern at end of string (followed by null) terminates loop\n  - Empty result possible if string contains only pattern\n\nCalled By:\n  - FUN_6fa0c580: Channel player leave notification formatting\n  - Other BNet message formatting functions (3 callers total)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
