      "name": "ValidateBinkInstallLocation",
      "signature": "int ValidateBinkInstallLocation(uint dwModuleInstance)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "Initializes lobby UI element Y positions based on language locale.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call GetLanguageLocaleId to get current locale\n2. If locale is English (9):\n   a. Set Y positions for child object types (0x62)\n   b. Set Y positions for text box types (0x62)\n   c. Set Y positions for game name/password/max players text boxes\n   d. Set Y positions for various lobby panel elements\n3. Store module instance handle in global\n4. Return 1 (success)\n\nParameters:\n  dwModuleInstance - Module instance handle passed from DLL entry point\n\nReturns:\n  1 - Always returns success\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Non-English locales only store module instance, skip UI layout adjustment\n- English locale (9) requires different Y positions for lobby elements\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  9     - English locale ID\n  0x62  - Y position for child/text box object types (98 decimal)\n  0x65  - Y position for game name label (101 decimal)\n  0x74  - Y position for panel descriptors (116 decimal)\n  0x82  - Y position for password text box (130 decimal)\n  0xb6  - Y position for max players text box (182 decimal)\n  0x60  - Y position for label elements (96 decimal)\n  0x81  - Y position for label element (129 decimal)\n  0xb7  - Y position for label element (183 decimal)\n  0xcd  - Y position for panel element (205 decimal)\n  0xee  - Y position for label element (238 decimal)\n  0x12d - Y position for label element (301 decimal)\n  0x151 - Y position for descriptors (337 decimal)\n  0x177 - Y position for panel elements (375 decimal)\n\nCalled from: entry (DLL main entry point)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
