      "name": "ClearBnetUIControlsAndSetDefaultInput",
      "signature": "void ClearBnetUIControlsAndSetDefaultInput(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Clears all Battle.net multiplayer UI controls and sets default input focus.\n\nClassification: Internal Utility - UI state reset helper\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Dispatch inventory item handler for g_pPanelBaseObject to clear base panel\n2. Dispatch inventory item handler for g_pGameNameEditBox to clear game name input\n3. Dispatch inventory item handler for g_pPasswordEditBox to clear password input\n4. Dispatch inventory item handler for g_pTextControl to clear text display\n5. Dispatch inventory item handler for g_pGameListSecondaryControl to clear secondary list\n6. Dispatch inventory item handler for g_pGameListContainer to clear main game list\n7. Dispatch inventory item handler for g_pCurrentInputControl to clear current input\n8. Dispatch inventory item handler for g_pGameNameLabel to clear game name label\n9. Dispatch inventory item handler for g_pPasswordLabel to clear password label\n10. Dispatch inventory item handler for g_pMaxPlayersLabel to clear max players label\n11. Dispatch inventory item handler for g_pDifficultyLabel to clear difficulty label\n12. Set current input item to g_apBnetUIObjects[10] (default input focus)\n\nParameters: None\n\nReturns: void\n\nCallers: Called by 14+ panel initialization and reset functions including:\n- EnterBattleNetMultiplayerUI, InitializePanelMode2\n- ResetInventoryPanelState, ResetInventoryPanelAndShowSelection\n- InitializeGameJoinSession, InitializeGameJoinAndCopySessionData\n- SetInventoryPanelVisibility, InitializePanelDisplayDefault\n\nPurpose: Ensures consistent UI state by clearing all Battle.net multiplayer\ncontrols before transitioning between UI states or resetting panels.\n\nExternal Calls:\n- DispatchInventoryItemHandler (D2WIN.DLL) - Clears/resets UI control state\n- SetCurrentInputItem (D2WIN.DLL) - Sets keyboard input focus to control",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
