      "name": "HandleMaxPlayersInputValidation",
      "signature": "int HandleMaxPlayersInputValidation(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "HandleMaxPlayersInputValidation - Validates and normalizes max players input field\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get Unicode text from g_pMaxPlayersInputField edit box child\n2. Convert Unicode to UTF-8 char buffer (max 5 characters)\n3. Parse the numeric value using atoi-like FUN_6fa138ab\n4. Format the parsed number back to string via FormatStringToBuffer\n5. Convert formatted char string to Unicode and update edit box\n6. Return 1 (success)\n\nParameters:\n  None (void)\n\nReturns:\n  int - Always returns 1 (success)\n\nGlobal Dependencies:\n  g_pMaxPlayersInputField - Pointer to max players input control\n  g_szFormattedMaxPlayers - Buffer for formatted string output\n  szFmtNumber - Format string for number conversion (\"%d\")\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Input limited to 5 characters (max value 99999)\n  - Function body is broken in Ghidra (single instruction) but\n    decompiler follows control flow correctly\n\nCalled As: Edit box input validation callback\nNOTE: Function body corrupted - only 1 instruction in body but\n      actual code extends to 0x6fa1049C (RETN 4)",
