      "name": "CrtFlushAndCleanupStreams",
      "signature": "int CrtFlushAndCleanupStreams(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "CrtFlushAndCleanupStreams - Flushes all active CRT file streams and frees extended stream slots.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Enter CRT critical section for stream table access\n2. Iterate through all streams starting at index 3\n3. For each valid stream with active flags (0x83 mask), flush it\n4. For streams with index > 19, delete critical section and free memory\n5. Leave critical section and return count of successfully flushed streams\n\nReturns: Number of streams successfully flushed",
